{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Escape Protocol Work together with your team to explore abandoned industrial zones, navigate mysterious liminal spaces, and survive terrifying entities lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends take on the role of scavengers sent into a series of procedurally generated Backrooms levels, each with unique environments and dangers. Your mission is to explore, collect valuable artifacts, and find an escape before time runs out. But be careful\u2014something is always watching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Multiplayer (1-8 players) \u2013 Team up with friends or go solo, but survival is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Unique Levels \u2013 Explore various eerie locations, including abandoned offices, decaying factories, underground tunnels, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying Entities \u2013 Face unpredictable AI-driven monsters that adapt to your movements and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Objectives \u2013 Find hidden exits, solve environmental puzzles, and manage resources to escape each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Levels, More Fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game features several handcrafted levels, with more planned in future updates. Each environment introduces new mechanics, threats, and challenges, ensuring that no two playthroughs feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter the  Backrooms Escape Protocol and uncover its dark secrets? Just remember\u2014don\u2019t look back.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575840?t=1744193657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575840/3b1fb0e3dbcb550a33e6aeb7c5a02c4bc62c6243/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744193657","capsule_image":"http